      "writtenOn": "2026-11-16T03:12:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you explain how the following scenario be mapped.\n\nScenario 1: MCTP Bus Owner using I2C (BMC) -\u003e connect to I2C Mux -\u003e multiple MCTP Targets using I2C (let\u0027s say as I2C1.1, I2C1.2 and I2C1.3 as an example).\n\nScenario 2: MCTP Bus Owner using I2C (BMC) -\u003e I2C Mux -\u003e 2 I2C Mux (path generated Dynamically) -\u003e mutiple MCTP Targets using I2C per mux like Scenario 1.\n\nScenario 3: An I3C Hub instead of I2C Mux (which supports I3C and I2C)?",
      "revId": "50cdd89482d6c93d7e4d8f3800883efa3aaa7b7a",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
