      "writtenOn": "2026-11-16T03:51:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Can you explain how the following scenario be mapped.\n\nWhen you say \u0027mapped\u0027, what is it that you looking for me to describe?\n\nWe need a process for taking the bus\u0027 device ID and resolving it to a particular device in the EM configuration, but that\u0027s an algorithmic problem that involves walking sysfs and EM configs. It seems you\u0027re after something more concrete. Is it how that algorithm would be applied in the contexts you\u0027ve listed? Or are you after diagrams and config snippets like are shown for cases through this document?",
      "parentUuid": "2c21f16d_414b3573",
      "revId": "50cdd89482d6c93d7e4d8f3800883efa3aaa7b7a",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
